<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>TechFest 2026</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:linear-gradient(to right,#1b4de4,#7b2cff);
    padding:30px;
}

.container{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:auto;
    background:#fff;
    border-radius:15px;
    padding:30px;
    box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
}

h1{
    text-align:center;
    color:#6a1bff;
}

h3{
    text-align:center;
    color:#555;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

h2{
    text-align:center;
    color:#2c4fb5;
    margin:15px 0;
}

p{
    text-align:center;
    color:#555;
}

.info{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    margin:25px 0;
    gap:20px;
}

.card{
    flex:1;
    padding:15px;
    border-radius:10px;
}

.yellow{
    background:#fff6c9;
}

.pink{
    background:#ffe0ef;
}

.form{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:15px;
    margin-top:20px;
}

input,select,textarea{
    width:100%;
    padding:10px;
    border:1px solid #ccc;
    border-radius:5px;
}

textarea{
    grid-column:1/3;
    height:100px;
}

.button{
    grid-column:1/3;
    text-align:center;
}

button{
    background:#0b82ff;
    color:white;
    padding:12px 30px;
    border:none;
    border-radius:25px;
    cursor:pointer;
    font-size:16px;
}

.events{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:15px;
    margin-top:30px;
}

.box{
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:10px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

.c1{background:#d8fbff;}
.c2{background:#f3e1ff;}
.c3{background:#dfffe8;}
.c4{background:#ffe2f2;}

.buttons{
    text-align:center;
    margin-top:25px;
}

.join{
    background:#7b2cff;
}

.schedule{
    background:white;
    color:#7b2cff;
    border:2px solid #7b2cff;
    margin-left:10px;
}

.footer{
    text-align:center;
    margin-top:30px;
    color:#555;
}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

<h1>TechFest 2026</h1>
<h3>Annual Technical Festival</h3>

<h2>You're Invited!</h2>

<p>
Join us for exciting technical events, coding competitions,
workshops, robotics, project exhibitions and fun activities.
</p>

<br>

<p><b>Date:</b> 20 September 2026</p>
<p><b>Time:</b> 10:00 AM</p>
<p><b>Venue:</b> College Auditorium</p>

<div class="buttons">
<button class="join">Register Now</button>
<button class="schedule">Learn More</button>
</div>

<div class="info">
<div class="card yellow">
<h4>📍 Venue</h4>
<p>SBJITMR Campus Auditorium</p>
</div>

<div class="card pink">
<h4>🎉 Events</h4>
<p>Hackathon, AI Workshop, Coding Contest, Robotics, Quiz</p>
</div>
</div>

<h2>Registration Form</h2>

<form class="form">

<input type="text" placeholder="Full Name">

<input type="email" placeholder="Email Address">

<input type="tel" placeholder="Mobile Number">

<select>
<option>Select Department</option>
<option>CSE</option>
<option>AIML</option>
<option>IT</option>
<option>ECE</option>
</select>

<select>
<option>Select Event</option>
<option>Hackathon</option>
<option>AI Workshop</option>
<option>Robotics</option>
<option>Gaming Zone</option>
</select>

<input type="text" placeholder="College Name">

<textarea placeholder="Write your message"></textarea>

<div class="button">
<button type="submit">Submit Registration</button>
</div>

</form>

<div class="events">

<div class="box c1">🤖<br>Robotics</div>

<div class="box c2">💻<br>Hackathon</div>

<div class="box c3">🧠<br>AI Workshop</div>

<div class="box c4">🎮<br>Gaming Zone</div>

</div>

<div class="buttons">
<button class="join">Join TECHFEST 2026</button>
<button class="schedule">View Schedule</button>
</div>

<div class="footer">
<h3>See You at TECHFEST 2026!</h3>
<p>SB Jain Institute of Technology, Management & Research, Nagpur</p>
<p>© 2026 TECHFEST | Annual Technical Festival</p>
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
